{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>זמרו</b> — the accent is on <i>שימו</i> [the prepositive mem, i.e., the word is mi-she-mu, accented on the final syllable]. For His praise is glory to you. And the meaning: through His praise you will be honored."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 66, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:48.300333601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}